1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:02,810
(Stuart:)Sorry, you want me to take
you to the dentist?

2
00:00:02,976 --> 00:00:05,646
(Sheldon:)Yes. And, now,
I can't make any promises...

3
00:00:05,812 --> 00:00:10,862
(Sheldon:)...but that's the sort of thing that gets a fella
on the list for the number eight friend slot.

4
00:00:11,734 --> 00:00:14,324
(Stuart:)Sheldon, I'm working.
I can't take you to the dentist.

5
00:00:14,487 --> 00:00:20,157
(Stuart:)Also, and I can't stress this enough,
I don't want to take you to the dentist.

6
00:00:21,035 --> 00:00:23,825
(Sheldon:)Can't help a friend out
in a time of need, huh?

7
00:00:23,997 --> 00:00:26,077
(Sheldon:)I see where your therapist
was coming from.

8
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:33,880
Ooh, ooh. What about we make
your astronaut nickname...

9
00:00:34,048 --> 00:00:37,218
...Howard "Buzz" Wolowitz?

10
00:00:38,261 --> 00:00:40,801
(Howard:)You can't do Buzz. Buzz is taken.

11
00:00:41,347 --> 00:00:43,437
(Raj:)Buzz Lightyear is not real.

12
00:00:47,228 --> 00:00:49,188
(Howard:)No, that's not what I'm talking about.

13
00:00:49,355 --> 00:00:52,105
(Raj:)Well, are you talking about
when he thought he was real?

14
00:00:55,194 --> 00:00:57,024
(Leonard:)No.

